---
---

<section id="beneficios" class="py-24 relative bg-slate-50 border-y border-slate-200/80">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16 space-y-4">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 text-xs text-[#0A559F] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">
        Ventajas Competitivas
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight">
        ¿Por qué elegir a <span class="text-gradient-ip">IP SISTEMAS</span>?
      </h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 text-base sm:text-lg">
        Diseñamos cada conexión con los más altos estándares técnicos para que disfrutes de internet sin complicaciones.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 4 Bento Feature Cards -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
      
      <!-- Card 1 -->
      <div class="feature-card bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200/90 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 group">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-red-50 border border-red-200/80 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
          ⚡
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-[#FC0432] transition-colors">Fibra Pura FTTH</h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          Conexión directa por hilo de vidrio sin cables coaxiales intermediarios. Velocidad simétrica con latencia ultrabaja.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2 -->
      <div class="feature-card bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200/90 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 group">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200/80 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
          🛡️
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-[#0A559F] transition-colors">Estabilidad 24/7</h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          Nodos centrales con respaldo energético y monitoreo proactivo para que tu servicio no se detenga.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3 -->
      <div class="feature-card bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200/90 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 group">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200/80 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
          📍
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-emerald-600 transition-colors">Soporte Local Valera</h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          Técnicos especializados en Trujillo con respuesta presencial rápida en tu domicilio o sede comercial.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 4 -->
      <div class="feature-card bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200/90 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 group">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-slate-100 border border-slate-200 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
          💳
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-slate-950 transition-colors">Portal Autogestionado</h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          Pagos en línea las 24 horas y consulta de estado de cuenta en tiempo real desde portal.ipsistemas.com.ve.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
